# Encounter overrides for Peragus (our own data, see
# crates/session/src/encounters.rs; never written into the game install).
#
# Mining Droid Mark II. Players found its shots too weak to be worth
# dodging (playtest feedback, 2026-11). Each of its mining laser's hits
# adds 1 point to the damage roll, about 15% more damage. In this area the
# tag g_droid_mine_02 names the Excavator and Environment Droids, which
# stay as they are.
damage drdspyder +1
